<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Andes interim net HK$51 mln.</title>
<headline>Pacific Andes interim net HK$51 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.65  vs 10.64</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs 2.58 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    51.00  vs 37.47</p>
<p>    Turnover		     723.47 vs 441.14</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pacific Andes International</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 23-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 4</p>
<p>NOTE - Pacific Andes is a frozen seafood supplier.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year end to December 31 from March 31. The comparative figures are for the six months ended September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>The comparative interim dividend is after the adjustment for the bonus issue of shares on August 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
